WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
 Marvel fans, I am here with
Jamie Foxx who plays Electro.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.190
What is it like returning
to this character

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:06.990
after all this time?

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:08.220
 It's been amazing, man.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.810
Like to be able to
reboot the character.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.310
New look, new vibe.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.250
And my kids here with
me representing Electro.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.160
They got the shoes.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.070
Representing Electro,
they got the shoes.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.920
So we just been, just been
happy to be on this ride

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.900
and can't wait for the
world to see the movie.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.520
 What's different
about Electro this time?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.210
 Well, the way he
looks right off the bat.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.010
It's a different look.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:30.270
He's super fly, potent, kind
of got a flyness to him.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:34.280
And so everybody online has
been really reacting well to it,

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.300
so just can't wait for
people to check it out.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.780
 I heard you brought
your own flavor to it.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:38.580
 Yeah.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.440
Yeah, you know, you got to
bring your flavor to it.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.960
So you know, the fact that
they were allowing, you know,

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.670
accommodating with that makes
the whole movie feel better.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.470
Yeah.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.210
 Well I'm excited to see it.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.220
What's the best part about
playing a super villain?

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.050
 Oh, it's always
good to be a bad guy.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.150
It's good being bad,
you know what I mean?

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.740
So it's like you're
doing Electro,

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.580
there's so many layers when
you're a super villain.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:58.380
You know what I mean?

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.870
So I can't wait for
you to check that out.

